      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "What the radios are actually doing. A radio being unblocked in rfkill only means its switch is on: an idle Bluetooth controller with no links costs close to nothing, which is why the live link count is here next to it. Virtual interfaces are left out because bridges and veth pairs are always up.",
